# Lets the anchor control panel keep the pmset wake schedule in sync with the
# launchd trigger without prompting for a password. Scoped to exactly that one
# pmset subcommand: it cannot run pmset with any other arguments, nor any
# other binary.
#
# install-ui.sh renders __USER__ and installs this for you.
__USER__ ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/pmset repeat wake MTWRFSU [0-2][0-9]\:[0-5][0-9]\:00
